WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.050
Every cycle-clique Ramsey number.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.253
Two red triangles, blue between, avoid both.

3
00:00:05.253 --> 00:00:07.707
One more vertex should always force one.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.354
A smallest counterexample breaks down, with a computer checking the small cases.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.593
Claimed: the formula holds for every pair.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.916
Main theorem in Lean.
